# 行尾：源码统一 LF；Windows 批处理必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd 会吃掉换行
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源：禁止 diff / 转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.wav binary
*.exe binary

# 语言统计：模型权重与倒出的大文件不计入语言占比
*.onnx binary linguist-generated
models/** binary linguist-generated

# 语言统计：介绍页与截图属于文档，不计入语言占比
docs/** linguist-documentation
site/** linguist-documentation
